{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "VideoStroll — a walkthrough of its own docs",
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8099/quickstart.html",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080,
    "deviceScaleFactor": 1
  },
  "voice": {
    "provider": "edge",
    "name": "en-US-AvaNeural",
    "rate": 1,
    "wordsPerMinute": 150
  },
  "captions": "both",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "narration": "This is the documentation for VideoStroll, a tool that lets an AI agent record narrated walkthroughs of a website. This video was recorded by the tool it is describing.",
      "actions": [],
      "chapter": "What it is"
    },
    {
      "id": "menu",
      "narration": "There are three pages. The quickstart you are looking at, a setup form, and a voice picker.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "move",
          "target": {
            "selector": "nav.pages"
          },
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "nav.pages"
          },
          "holdMs": 1800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prereqs",
      "narration": "Getting started needs one thing: Node, version 20 or newer. The video encoder ships inside the package, so there is nothing else to install.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prereqs"
          },
          "durationMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prereqs p strong"
          },
          "holdMs": 2000
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "Setting it up"
    },
    {
      "id": "copy-button",
      "narration": "Every command on the page has a copy button, so nothing has to be retyped.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "move",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prereqs .copy"
          },
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prereqs .copy"
          },
          "holdMs": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prereqs .snip"
          },
          "holdMs": 1500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ask",
      "narration": "Once it is installed, you ask for a walkthrough in plain words. The agent reads the page, drafts the steps, records them one at a time, and checks what it recorded against what it said.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#use"
          },
          "durationMs": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#use pre.say"
          },
          "holdMs": 2500
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "Asking for a walkthrough"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs",
      "narration": "Before writing a word of narration, the agent looks for the product's own documentation. What comes back is vocabulary, not pages — the product's nouns, its procedures, and how to say the awkward names aloud.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#docs"
          },
          "durationMs": 1100
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#docs ul"
          },
          "holdMs": 2600
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "Reading the product's docs"
    },
    {
      "id": "to-setup",
      "narration": "If writing that sentence is the part you would rather skip, the setup page asks the questions instead.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "target": {
            "selector": "header"
          },
          "durationMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "target": {
            "selector": "nav.pages a[href=\"/setup.html\"]"
          },
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "nav.pages a[href=\"/setup.html\"]"
          },
          "settleMs": 1200
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "The setup form"
    },
    {
      "id": "fill-form",
      "narration": "Answer what you know, in plain words. Nothing is saved or sent anywhere — it all happens in your browser.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#url"
          },
          "settleMs": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#url"
          },
          "text": "https://example.com",
          "msPerChar": 55
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#title"
          },
          "text": "A tour of Example",
          "msPerChar": 45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "either-or",
      "narration": "The right side fills in as you type, and it offers two ways to start. You take one, not both.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "move",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".card.choose"
          },
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".card.choose"
          },
          "holdMs": 2200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "voices",
      "narration": "The third page is the voice picker. Filter by locale, gender or character, and play a sample before you commit to one.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "move",
          "target": {
            "selector": "nav.pages a[href=\"/voices.html\"]"
          },
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "nav.pages a[href=\"/voices.html\"]"
          },
          "settleMs": 1800
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": ".controls"
          },
          "holdMs": 2000
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "Choosing a voice"
    },
    {
      "id": "ava",
      "narration": "42 English voices out of 322. This one, Ava, is the voice you have been listening to.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "target": {
            "selector": "tr:has-text(\"en-US-AvaNeural\")"
          },
          "durationMs": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "tr:has-text(\"en-US-AvaNeural\")"
          },
          "holdMs": 2500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outputs",
      "narration": "Out comes an MP4, captions as a file and burned in, and the storyboard that produced it. When the site changes, you edit the steps that changed and render again, rather than recording the whole thing twice.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8099/quickstart.html",
          "waitUntil": "load"
        },
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#output"
          },
          "durationMs": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#output .grid"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000
        }
      ],
      "chapter": "What you get"
    }
  ]
}
